    "title": "LivHub - Video Chat Online",
    "description": "LivHub is where you can make a home for your communities and friends. You can stay close and have fun over text, voice, and video chat.\r\n\r\nFunctions \r\n-Send a message directly to a friend or call them up with our video chat feature\r\n-Keep in touch with your friends and call them anytime\r\n-Free instant translation and break the language barriers\r\n-Get to know more people from all over the world\r\n\r\nInstall LivHub now and open your heart to meet new people! Step a little forward with LivHub. Wider your social circle now!\r\n\r\n-- Privacy and security --\r\nWe take privacy and security seriously at Livuhub. All information about chat users is protected from theft and unauthorized use. This includes video calls and all other forms of communication, which are completely secure.\r\n\r\nIf a user violates any video chat rules, we encourage you to report them, and we will take necessary actions that may include blocking their account. Your personal information and data are always safe with us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "LivHub is where you can make a home for your communities and friends. You can stay close and have fun over text, voice, and video chat.<br><br>Functions <br>-Send a message directly to a friend or call them up with our video chat feature<br>-Keep in touch with your friends and call them anytime<br>-Free instant translation and break the language barriers<br>-Get to know more people from all over the world<br><br>Install LivHub now and open your heart to meet new people! Step a little forward with LivHub. Wider your social circle now!<br><br>-- Privacy and security --<br>We take privacy and security seriously at Livuhub. All information about chat users is protected from theft and unauthorized use. This includes video calls and all other forms of communication, which are completely secure.<br><br>If a user violates any video chat rules, we encourage you to report them, and we will take necessary actions that may include blocking their account. Your personal information and data are always safe with us.",
